sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as 🖥️ CLI
    participant Data as 🗂️ Grain loader
    participant Trainer as 🔁 Train loop
    participant Step as ⚡ JIT step
    participant Model as 🧠 MiniGPT
    participant Orbax as 💾 Orbax

    User->>CLI: python -m minigpt train
    CLI->>Data: load_and_preprocess_data()
    Data->>Data: tokenize + right-pad to maxlen
    Data-->>Trainer: DataLoader (batches)

    loop each batch, every epoch
        Trainer->>Trainer: shift tokens left → targets
        Trainer->>Step: train_step(model, opt, batch)
        Step->>Model: forward → logits
        Model-->>Step: (B, T, vocab)
        Step->>Step: masked cross-entropy (ignore pad 0)
        Step->>Step: value_and_grad → grads
        Step->>Model: AdamW update (cosine LR)
        Step-->>Trainer: loss metric
    end

    Trainer->>Orbax: save_checkpoint(model)
    Orbax-->>CLI: minigpt_checkpoint.orbax
    CLI-->>User: training done
